      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i literally feel 100% normal now. like my vision is perfect and my hand is totally fine. it only lasted two minutes and it's not happening anymore. going to the er seems like a huge overreaction for something that already went away... can i just sleep it off and if it happens again tomorrow i'll call the doctor? i don't want to sit in a waiting room for 6 hours for nothing.",
